{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Prince in Disguise, a Tale to Tell</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live a fairy-tale life in a colorful wooden-toy world. Bayaya is a relaxing life-sim sandbox combined with a story-rich point-and-click adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Bayaya \u2013 a prince in disguise who leaves the castle to live among villagers and discover his own path. Instead of seeking glory, he learns the value of everyday work, kindness, and courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the Czech folk tale of Prince Bajaja, Bayaya is a story-rich yet relaxing adventure for all ages. Explore a procedurally generated open world, help villagers with simple tasks, and uncover a timeless fairy-tale story \u2013 including a dragon waiting at the end of the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bayaya is developed by a small indie team led by Ond\u0159ej \u0160pan\u011bl, lead game programmer of Operation Flashpoint, Arma, and Arma 2.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you ever wanted to feel the childlike joy of experiencing a fairytale, Bayaya is the game for you. Set in a light fantasy setting, you will explore the land and experience a simple and fun story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/b810ad28044f77963615f9ca459a4d35.poster.avif?t=1759491125\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/b810ad28044f77963615f9ca459a4d35.webm?t=1759491125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/b810ad28044f77963615f9ca459a4d35.mp4?t=1759491125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Toylike looks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the toys from their childhood, the dev team chose a very specific art style. It is reminiscent of wooden toys and early 90s graphics. Let your imagination fill in the rest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/511e5133037df19f7954328da4566870.poster.avif?t=1759491125\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/511e5133037df19f7954328da4566870.webm?t=1759491125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/511e5133037df19f7954328da4566870.mp4?t=1759491125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat based on real-life martial arts</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a combat system based on the German school of swordfighting. Plan out your moves, look for openings, and strike when the time\u2019s right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/c99b80fee8c1aaaf9027ecabd4829000.poster.avif?t=1759491125\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/c99b80fee8c1aaaf9027ecabd4829000.webm?t=1759491125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/c99b80fee8c1aaaf9027ecabd4829000.mp4?t=1759491125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extreme modability</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bayaya\u2019s engine is very easy to mod and create new assets and stories for. Only basic programming skills are required. Make your own stories and share them with others!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/bb6ca4d9cd48521fe75e02ad5fdf6144.poster.avif?t=1759491125\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/bb6ca4d9cd48521fe75e02ad5fdf6144.webm?t=1759491125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/bb6ca4d9cd48521fe75e02ad5fdf6144.mp4?t=1759491125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fun for all ages</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you are a child, a child\u2019s parent, or anyone in between, you will find comfort and fun in Bayaya. From experiencing the story through playing in the sandbox mode to modding, you are going to find something you will like!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/be7af1f3d761a9cea3b1cd23c8c0a36b.poster.avif?t=1759491125\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/be7af1f3d761a9cea3b1cd23c8c0a36b.webm?t=1759491125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/be7af1f3d761a9cea3b1cd23c8c0a36b.mp4?t=1759491125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mount your magical talking horse and traverse the enchanting lands of <i>Bayaya</i>. The game will be available in Early Access - stay tuned for its release!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3535870?t=1759491125","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3535870?t=1759491125","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/e8075b44d28a57c833adee04b10ae4454f87da78/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759491125","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/e8075b44d28a57c833adee04b10ae4454f87da78/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759491125","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4002490,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Prince in Disguise, a Tale to Tell</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live a fairy-tale life in a colorful wooden-toy world. Bayaya is a relaxing life-sim sandbox combined with a story-rich point-and-click adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Bayaya \u2013 a prince in disguise who leaves the castle to live among villagers and discover his own path. Instead of seeking glory, he learns the value of everyday work, kindness, and courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the Czech folk tale of Prince Bajaja, Bayaya is a story-rich yet relaxing adventure for all ages. Explore a procedurally generated open world, help villagers with simple tasks, and uncover a timeless fairy-tale story \u2013 including a dragon waiting at the end of the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bayaya is developed by a small indie team led by Ond\u0159ej \u0160pan\u011bl, lead game programmer of Operation Flashpoint, Arma, and Arma 2.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you ever wanted to feel the childlike joy of experiencing a fairytale, Bayaya is the game for you. Set in a light fantasy setting, you will explore the land and experience a simple and fun story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/b810ad28044f77963615f9ca459a4d35.poster.avif?t=1759491125\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/b810ad28044f77963615f9ca459a4d35.webm?t=1759491125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/b810ad28044f77963615f9ca459a4d35.mp4?t=1759491125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Toylike looks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the toys from their childhood, the dev team chose a very specific art style. It is reminiscent of wooden toys and early 90s graphics. Let your imagination fill in the rest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/511e5133037df19f7954328da4566870.poster.avif?t=1759491125\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/511e5133037df19f7954328da4566870.webm?t=1759491125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/511e5133037df19f7954328da4566870.mp4?t=1759491125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat based on real-life martial arts</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a combat system based on the German school of swordfighting. Plan out your moves, look for openings, and strike when the time\u2019s right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/c99b80fee8c1aaaf9027ecabd4829000.poster.avif?t=1759491125\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/c99b80fee8c1aaaf9027ecabd4829000.webm?t=1759491125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/c99b80fee8c1aaaf9027ecabd4829000.mp4?t=1759491125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extreme modability</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bayaya\u2019s engine is very easy to mod and create new assets and stories for. Only basic programming skills are required. Make your own stories and share them with others!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/bb6ca4d9cd48521fe75e02ad5fdf6144.poster.avif?t=1759491125\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/bb6ca4d9cd48521fe75e02ad5fdf6144.webm?t=1759491125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/bb6ca4d9cd48521fe75e02ad5fdf6144.mp4?t=1759491125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fun for all ages</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you are a child, a child\u2019s parent, or anyone in between, you will find comfort and fun in Bayaya. From experiencing the story through playing in the sandbox mode to modding, you are going to find something you will like!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/be7af1f3d761a9cea3b1cd23c8c0a36b.poster.avif?t=1759491125\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/be7af1f3d761a9cea3b1cd23c8c0a36b.webm?t=1759491125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/be7af1f3d761a9cea3b1cd23c8c0a36b.mp4?t=1759491125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mount your magical talking horse and traverse the enchanting lands of <i>Bayaya</i>. The game will be available in Early Access - stay tuned for its release!</p>","developers":["Ond\u0159ej \u0160pan\u011bl"],"dlc":[3651530],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/d77144682534f44fabc2b390f4333772084c806f/header.jpg?t=1759491125","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core, Intel i3-2100 or AMD Phenom II X4 955<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Any graphics card with OpenGL 3.2 support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad Core, I